      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I finally note that the domain resolving for \"vrchat.com\" is having problem in China, even if you're using Google DNS. For VRC, it's expected to be resolved to two cloudflare ip (104.18.7.156, 104.18.6.156). But only in China (why?), it's resolved to some non-cloudflare ip randomly, causing the final upload step to fail. It was fixed by adding this two lines to hosts file.\n\n104.18.7.156 vrchat.com\n\n104.18.6.156 vrchat.com",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
